# The release of anti-lang/llvm-tools that the LLVM tools of each host
# come from. Each host names its tag in its row <host>-tag, since Eddie
# released the rebuild anti.9 for the two macOS hosts first, on 2026-11-07.
# The version stands in tools/llvm-version alone, and @VERSION@ takes it.
# The tag adds the counter of the rebuilds of that version. An asset is
# named after the tag and the host, which @TAG@ and @HOST@ take. Each
# digest is the SHA-256 of the asset of that host. tools/clang-pin names
# the same tag for each host, and antic_release_pin of tools/pins.cmake
# reads both pins.
release=https://github.com/anti-lang/llvm-tools/releases/download/@TAG@
file=llvm-tools-@TAG@-@HOST@.tar.xz
